## Title: Quartermaster
## Description: Keeps your bags tidy at a merchant: repairs your gear and sells the clutter (marked junk, trash, treasure, looted potions and poisons, green repair kits, Ornate gear of any quality, white gear, companion gear), then tells you in chat what it sold. It also recharges your equipped weapons with soul gems when their charge drops to the percentage you choose (10% by default). Every kind of item is a switch in Settings > Add-Ons > Quartermaster, with traits to keep for armor, weapons, jewelry and companion gear. Never sells locked, stolen or Crown items, anything your characters crafted, gold gear, or gear you'd deconstruct. Items your characters crafted, and set gear with a kept trait, are also hidden from the Sell, deconstruction and Ragpicker lists; click the right stick to show them. Formerly Keep My Crafts. Find it useful? Gold donations by in-game mail to @DextrousDigits (Xbox NA or EU) are very welcome.
## Author: ESO Companion
## Version: 2.2.0
## AddOnVersion: 4
## APIVersion: 101051
## SavedVariables: ESOCKeepMyCrafts_SV
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings

